kind: skit
id: letter
title: Dear Sandwich
about: Scribe the typewriter helps Pip write a letter by finishing every sentence

[scene 1]
pip: "Scribe, can you help me write a letter to my"
scribe: "Sandwich?"
pip: "To my grandmother!" ; do gasp
scribe: "Dear Grandmother, you are my favorite sandwich."

[scene 2]
clank: "It is close. It is not correct. But it is close." ; do nod
pip: "Let me try. Dear Grandmother, I miss you."
scribe: "And your sandwiches."
pip: "Okay. That part is true." ; do shrug
